Jungle decorations use REFI Textures assets under the accompanying REFI_LICENSE.txt.
The grayscale tall grass and fern textures have a baked grass tint.
Mahogany bark, end grain and planks are warm recolors of refi_dark_oak_log_side,
refi_dark_oak_log_top and refi_dark_oak_planks. Mahogany foliage uses the dark oak
leaf pattern with a baked tropical tint, distinct from Jungle foliage.

